$NAME
=====

$DESCRIPTION

Version: $VERSION
Publisher: $PUBLISHER
Homepage: $HOMEPAGE
Release date: $RELEASEDATA

This DMG was created by the CQtDeployer "dmg" option (issue #899).

How to use:
1. Open this DMG file (double click on it in the Finder).
2. Drag the "$NAME" folder into the Applications folder (the
   Applications folder is available as a symbolic link in this window).
3. Launch the application from the Applications folder (the run script
   of the package starts the application with the right environment).
